## Code Example

```javascript
function fidelity(source, summary, lang) {
  const sim = crossLingualSim(source, summary, lang);
  const back = backTranslate(summary, lang);
  const drift = compare(source, back);
  return { score: combine(sim, drift), explanation: driftReason(drift) };
}
```

